WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.500 --> 01:46.890
=Episode 25=

02:21.960 --> 02:24.710
The people from the Hengdao Sect seem
to bear no ill will towards Little Yue.

02:25.910 --> 02:26.960
We will find her.

02:38.120 --> 02:40.360
Is Luohuan settled in?

02:50.510 --> 02:53.760
Xiaoyuan, you've made a mistake again.

02:54.590 --> 02:55.690
I haven't.

02:56.460 --> 02:58.190
You only care about the "people".

02:58.190 --> 03:00.510
We mean nothing to you.

03:04.790 --> 03:05.840
Xiaoyuan.

03:12.280 --> 03:14.510
Go confine yourself

03:14.510 --> 03:16.000
for three days!

03:18.870 --> 03:22.790
Xuwei, Xiaoyuan is still young.
She doesn't understand.

03:32.370 --> 03:33.970
How is Luohuan's injury?

03:36.690 --> 03:38.490
The power
of Qi's Thought Sword is strong.

03:39.690 --> 03:41.730
Huan is severely injured.

03:44.210 --> 03:45.230
I got it.

03:47.850 --> 03:51.810
Tomorrow is the day
of the transaction with Luo Maiming.

03:52.890 --> 03:54.650
It is of top importance.

03:56.329 --> 03:59.730
Once the transaction is complete,
bring Yue Jinzhao back.

04:02.010 --> 04:03.020
Got it.

04:14.170 --> 04:18.930
Qingfei, what's wrong?

04:19.930 --> 04:20.970
It's all my fault.

04:22.570 --> 04:26.120
If I had stopped Huan at the time,

04:26.120 --> 04:27.210
he wouldn't have...

04:32.210 --> 04:35.810
This has nothing to do with you.
It was his fate.

05:07.250 --> 05:08.410
I'll go check on him.

05:30.250 --> 05:32.970
Luohuan, I didn't protect you well.

05:33.930 --> 05:35.810
You've been hurt so badly.

05:38.530 --> 05:39.600
Come here.

05:43.650 --> 05:46.290
Why is our little leader crying?

05:48.170 --> 05:50.490
Don't worry.

05:51.050 --> 05:52.770
I will be fine after some rest.

05:54.090 --> 05:56.290
Really? You're not lying to me?

05:56.930 --> 05:59.850
Of course not.
I'm a physician, after all.

06:00.450 --> 06:02.610
Could I not know my condition?

06:05.010 --> 06:07.090
You must rest well.

06:11.530 --> 06:13.330
Didn't Xuwei confine you
as a punishment?

06:14.050 --> 06:17.690
Aren't you afraid he'll punish you
more heavily for sneaking out?

06:18.650 --> 06:20.770
I just wanted to come see you.

06:24.970 --> 06:26.810
Ying Xuwei is very bad.

06:29.210 --> 06:30.530
Luohuan, I'll come see you again.

06:30.530 --> 06:31.560
Run.

06:41.450 --> 06:42.540
Xuwei.

07:07.010 --> 07:12.330
Xuwei, this confinement
is practically a joke.

07:31.370 --> 07:35.090
Unexpectedly, Qi's powerful enough

07:36.210 --> 07:38.090
to break my Resonance Spell.

07:39.450 --> 07:43.050
Good. I can use this time

07:43.930 --> 07:45.850
to improve my medical skills.

07:58.330 --> 07:59.370
Luohuan.

08:02.170 --> 08:03.180
Do you regret it?

08:08.730 --> 08:11.370
What is there to regret, Xuwei?

08:12.610 --> 08:15.050
Didn't we know all this would happen?

08:16.690 --> 08:18.210
Things might have taken
a different turn,

08:18.730 --> 08:21.370
but isn't it still pretty much
what we expected?

08:52.130 --> 08:53.130
Luohuan.

08:55.970 --> 08:57.000
I'm sorry.

08:59.970 --> 09:03.010
Xuwei, you've done nothing wrong.

09:04.890 --> 09:08.530
If there is any wrong,
it's only to yourself.

09:10.530 --> 09:15.730
Some missions
shouldn't be shouldered by you alone.

09:22.730 --> 09:23.760
Xuwei.

10:19.340 --> 10:24.080
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

10:24.080 --> 10:28.010
♪Burns what once was♪

10:28.010 --> 10:32.330
♪The name is forgotten♪

10:35.370 --> 10:39.720
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

10:39.720 --> 10:44.200
♪Only through the eyes♪

10:44.200 --> 10:48.240
♪Who can see them clearly♪

10:49.420 --> 10:56.140
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

10:57.450 --> 11:04.270
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

11:05.810 --> 11:13.390
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

11:13.390 --> 11:20.750
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

11:28.730 --> 11:31.970
Qi, to deal with Zhu Yu,

11:33.730 --> 11:35.010
I need your blood.

11:46.010 --> 11:47.210
Have a good rest.

11:52.490 --> 11:53.580
Jinzhao.

11:59.340 --> 12:04.650
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

12:05.490 --> 12:06.540
Jinzhao.

12:07.470 --> 12:15.210
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

12:15.210 --> 12:23.530
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

12:28.170 --> 12:30.930
The jade pendant on you is quite unique.

12:32.930 --> 12:34.090
Jinzhao gave it to me.

12:39.530 --> 12:47.370
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

12:47.370 --> 12:55.530
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

12:55.530 --> 13:05.130
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪

13:12.840 --> 13:13.900
Come take a look.

13:21.870 --> 13:22.960
Come take a look.

13:27.440 --> 13:28.490
Wait for me.

13:28.490 --> 13:29.550
Uncle Wang.

13:37.580 --> 13:38.760
(Favorable Weather)

13:58.770 --> 14:01.050
What a peaceful scene!

14:01.770 --> 14:06.010
Such a pity that it will cease
to exist in a moment.

14:08.770 --> 14:09.840
Thanks to you.

14:11.330 --> 14:12.610
You seem reluctant.

14:16.250 --> 14:17.260
Do you care?

14:17.260 --> 14:19.010
Of course not.

14:23.570 --> 14:25.410
The weather is going to change.

14:37.890 --> 14:40.370
A storm is approaching.

14:41.010 --> 14:44.170
Why hasn't my father returned yet?
I'll go pick him up.

14:52.090 --> 14:53.930
Why does she look so much like Zhaoyan?

14:55.210 --> 14:56.890
What relation is her of mine?

15:05.330 --> 15:10.930
Back then, they sacrificed
me here to secure Rehai.

15:12.170 --> 15:15.010
I walked onto the sacrificial altar
with a smile.

15:16.250 --> 15:20.330
They exchanged my life
for peace for the many.

15:21.770 --> 15:23.330
How grand it was.

15:24.330 --> 15:27.970
(But it was only after my death
that I discovered)

15:28.930 --> 15:31.770
(my soul was bound with Rehai
to the Luo family.)

15:33.090 --> 15:37.530
(Decades later, the Luo family
had a pair of twins.)

15:38.650 --> 15:41.490
(My soul then possessed one of them,)

15:43.330 --> 15:46.170
(and the other's life force
continuously flowed to me.)

15:48.290 --> 15:50.130
(But we were destined to die young.)

15:51.290 --> 15:54.730
(Since then, I have been reborn
time and again as a twin.)

15:55.690 --> 15:59.330
(My immortality and the premature death
of generations of Luo's twins)

15:59.330 --> 16:02.220
(are the curse for defying heaven.)

16:02.730 --> 16:06.370
As the guardian of Rehai,
I've been using it to benefit myself.

16:07.090 --> 16:08.810
Now, I'm resolved to right my wrongs

16:09.330 --> 16:12.570
by releasing Rehai.

16:23.210 --> 16:24.240
Master?

16:25.000 --> 16:26.060
Zhaoyan?

16:29.170 --> 16:31.170
Why didn't Ying Xuwei stop her?

16:32.610 --> 16:36.010
Cang Feng, prepare
to welcome the Master.

16:36.010 --> 16:39.010
Ensure the Master's safety at all costs.

16:39.610 --> 16:40.650
Yes.

16:55.050 --> 16:58.090
Zhaoyan, you have returned after all.

16:59.290 --> 17:01.250
Did you tell the Hengdao Sect
about our trip

17:01.810 --> 17:02.850
to the Mangwan Village?

17:05.369 --> 17:07.130
Why did you do that, Maiming?

17:10.250 --> 17:11.329
Do you still trust me?

17:13.810 --> 17:14.890
Yes.

17:17.530 --> 17:19.329
It's a long story.

17:34.530 --> 17:36.620
I'm not interested in
why you cooperate with Bian Luohuan.

17:37.170 --> 17:39.250
You're Zhaoyan's brother.
I don't want to give you a hard time.

17:39.250 --> 17:40.610
I just want to know some things.

17:41.650 --> 17:43.080
Tell me everything you know.

17:45.710 --> 17:46.800
Mr. Luo.

17:52.450 --> 17:54.290
It seems to be a labyrinth spell.

17:58.610 --> 18:00.090
Maiming, what are you going to do?

18:01.970 --> 18:04.050
I will fulfill my long-cherished wish.

18:05.250 --> 18:08.650
A long-cherished wish? You're gonna
undo the Bloodbinding of Rehai?

18:09.610 --> 18:10.610
Have you found a way?

18:13.130 --> 18:15.770
Is this the reason
you've been deceiving me?

18:15.770 --> 18:17.810
I've been trapped here
for over 200 years.

18:18.330 --> 18:21.690
I've finally found a way out.
How can I miss it?

18:24.330 --> 18:25.390
Zhaoyan.

18:27.330 --> 18:28.330
Maiming.

18:31.450 --> 18:32.460
Maiming.

18:34.930 --> 18:37.170
Is there a way to break this barrier?

18:41.450 --> 18:43.050
Every barrier has its own flaws.

18:43.610 --> 18:45.970
Flaws. Let's go find the flaws.

18:52.410 --> 18:54.650
Our family is so renowned

18:54.650 --> 18:56.210
in the Western Regions.

18:57.330 --> 19:00.910
Even in the Central Plains,
we're a prestigious family.

19:00.910 --> 19:01.930
Yes.

19:01.930 --> 19:04.890
All thanks to Master Luo.

19:04.890 --> 19:08.770
He's a good master. He eradicates
bandits, purges evil cults

19:08.770 --> 19:10.930
and guards the peace here.

19:10.930 --> 19:13.850
Our family has thus earned
its far-reaching reputation.

19:13.850 --> 19:16.610
That's right. Drink up, come on.

19:16.610 --> 19:17.640
Come on.

19:19.890 --> 19:20.930
Who is that on the tower?

19:21.710 --> 19:23.690
The weather is really nice today.

19:25.530 --> 19:27.450
You've just married a local.
You might not know.

19:27.450 --> 19:30.450
Only the Master
has the key to the Octagonal Tower.

19:30.450 --> 19:34.330
And this person is Master Luo Zhaoyan.

19:36.450 --> 19:39.850
The ceremony must be starting soon
as the Master has ascended the tower.

19:39.850 --> 19:41.250
Let's go to the bottom of the tower.

19:41.250 --> 19:42.770
- Okay.
- Okay, let's go together.

19:42.770 --> 19:43.820
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

20:50.120 --> 20:51.210
What is this?

20:51.760 --> 20:53.090
What's going on?

20:53.090 --> 20:54.810
Is the Master over there?

20:57.550 --> 20:58.650
Look.

20:58.650 --> 20:59.660
What is it?

21:14.930 --> 21:16.300
(Favorable Weather)

22:05.410 --> 22:06.480
Father.

22:09.170 --> 22:11.410
What took you so long?

22:11.410 --> 22:12.730
The grand ceremony is about to start.

22:13.970 --> 22:15.890
The Master has entrusted
the business to me.

22:16.490 --> 22:18.830
We must not let him down.

22:19.490 --> 22:21.390
The Yinghui Fort has been unsettled
these past two days.

22:22.010 --> 22:24.770
Dealing with the business affairs
took a bit longer than expected.

22:26.210 --> 22:28.170
Then let's go. I'll take it.

22:30.220 --> 22:31.250
Murder!

22:31.250 --> 22:32.610
They're killed! Run!

22:34.330 --> 22:35.790
What happened?

22:35.790 --> 22:38.170
Luo Zhaoyan has killed many people
in the mansion using evil magic.

22:38.170 --> 22:39.180
You should run too!

22:40.290 --> 22:43.890
Zhao... Zhaoyan. Father,
he wouldn't have.

22:44.460 --> 22:45.570
I'll go and see.

22:45.570 --> 22:46.690
I'll go too.

22:46.690 --> 22:49.010
No, you stay here. Be good.

22:56.530 --> 22:57.550
Strange.

22:59.690 --> 23:02.850
The power sustaining
the barrier is weakening.

23:10.530 --> 23:11.600
Zhaoyan.

23:13.770 --> 23:14.920
That's not right.

23:14.920 --> 23:15.970
What's wrong?

23:15.970 --> 23:16.970
That's not right.

23:24.090 --> 23:25.130
This painting...

23:27.410 --> 23:29.210
I think it's far inferior to that one.

23:35.290 --> 23:38.610
I gave this painting to Maiming.

23:39.330 --> 23:41.010
He wouldn't hang
the painting in his room.

23:42.570 --> 23:43.660
There's something wrong with it.

23:44.450 --> 23:45.450
I'll do it.

23:45.450 --> 23:46.480
Wait.

24:02.250 --> 24:03.310
The barrier has been broken.

24:07.850 --> 24:08.890
Are you alright?

24:08.890 --> 24:10.370
Yes. Let's look for Maiming.

24:22.010 --> 24:25.370
Just a little longer.

24:40.970 --> 24:42.000
Maiming.

24:43.730 --> 24:45.250
Maiming.

24:45.250 --> 24:47.410
How can it be snowing
at this time of year?

24:47.970 --> 24:48.970
Maiming.

24:49.570 --> 24:51.050
Be careful, Zhaoyan.

24:51.690 --> 24:53.490
Xian Qing, you stay with Zhaoyan.

24:53.490 --> 24:54.570
I'll go look for Luo Maiming.

25:28.240 --> 25:29.260
Master.

25:29.810 --> 25:30.830
Don't come closer.

25:43.970 --> 25:45.690
Zhaoyan.

25:47.530 --> 25:48.560
Are you okay?

25:53.530 --> 25:57.050
That spell is absorbing
Zhaoyan's Vitality Energy.

26:17.530 --> 26:18.570
Master.

26:22.490 --> 26:25.810
How's Zhaoyan?

26:26.930 --> 26:28.130
Master Luo is still alive.

26:45.730 --> 26:47.650
It's been over 200 years.

26:53.170 --> 26:55.290
200 years.

27:06.850 --> 27:07.920
Get up.

27:41.730 --> 27:44.530
The spell is slowly fading.

27:45.810 --> 27:46.860
Xian Qing.

27:48.010 --> 27:49.070
Zhaoyan.

27:54.170 --> 27:55.180
Up.

28:48.010 --> 28:49.040
Madman.

28:58.530 --> 28:59.600
Zhaoyan.

29:45.690 --> 29:46.700
Stop.

29:53.050 --> 29:54.290
Move aside.

29:54.290 --> 29:58.090
Only the Master can go upstairs.

29:58.930 --> 30:00.850
Don't you know your master has gone mad?

30:02.170 --> 30:03.210
I'll go upstairs myself.

30:06.050 --> 30:07.050
Let her go.

30:58.850 --> 31:02.290
Zhaoyan, I am finally free,

31:05.730 --> 31:07.850
and I have finally destroyed
the Luo family.

31:11.650 --> 31:15.370
Yes, you've done it.

31:28.810 --> 31:30.010
You want to kill me?

31:32.290 --> 31:34.130
You killed so many innocent people.

31:35.450 --> 31:36.450
You must pay for it.

31:37.090 --> 31:38.160
Innocent?

31:39.330 --> 31:42.130
I was merely taking back everything
the Luo family owed me.

31:43.330 --> 31:45.770
They were just ordinary people
who knew nothing.

31:47.610 --> 31:49.010
So many lives.

31:49.690 --> 31:51.370
You must pay for them.

32:05.330 --> 32:07.290
Can you really do it?

32:09.260 --> 32:14.760
♪Twin flowers bloom on the same branch♪

32:14.760 --> 32:19.820
♪Autumn comes and spring goes.
Eventually they fall♪

32:20.880 --> 32:25.800
♪The sun rises and the moon sets♪

32:25.800 --> 32:30.190
♪Giving you a gentle answer♪

32:30.850 --> 32:35.210
Zhaoyan, compared to you,

32:36.490 --> 32:37.850
their lives were nothing.

32:40.770 --> 32:42.690
Compared to me?

32:49.250 --> 32:52.890
You sacrificed the entire clan for me?

32:54.890 --> 32:57.450
I never thought of harming you.

32:57.450 --> 33:02.030
♪I promise you a lifetime
of joy and yearning♪

33:02.030 --> 33:08.300
♪Burying your past
in the hustle and bustle♪

33:08.300 --> 33:14.480
♪I'll accompany you
through ups and downs♪

33:14.480 --> 33:20.590
♪Don't be afraid♪

33:20.590 --> 33:26.600
♪Writing about your struggle♪

33:26.600 --> 33:32.910
♪Being irrational and silly
because of you♪

33:35.890 --> 33:38.530
The moment I learned
the method to break the binding,

33:40.970 --> 33:43.530
the Luo family was doomed to this end.

33:49.650 --> 33:51.170
You shouldn't have hurt her like this.

33:51.770 --> 33:53.010
I shouldn't have.

33:55.770 --> 33:56.930
Since the Bloodbinding is undone,

33:57.570 --> 33:59.690
Mr. Luo, please come with us.

34:01.250 --> 34:02.280
Will you go or not?

34:03.020 --> 34:08.460
♪Endless mist weaves
a tapestry of falling petals♪

34:09.070 --> 34:14.480
♪Sending you
a priceless promise on my behalf♪

34:14.480 --> 34:19.790
♪Let worries melt away with the blood♪

34:19.790 --> 34:24.560
♪Can you hear my mumble of love♪

34:25.320 --> 34:31.210
♪Writing about your struggle♪

34:31.210 --> 34:37.480
♪Being irrational and silly
because of you♪

34:41.010 --> 34:42.030
I'll chase after them.

34:44.139 --> 34:50.159
♪No answer, no giving up♪

34:52.210 --> 34:55.449
Undoing the Bloodbinding
requires the blood of your family.

34:56.370 --> 34:58.930
The closer the kinship,
the more effective the blood.

35:00.250 --> 35:02.060
If one is unwilling to use
the blood of close kin,

35:02.690 --> 35:05.290
they could try
the blood of the entire clan.

35:07.050 --> 35:10.370
Sacrificing the clan
just for one person.

35:11.770 --> 35:15.450
What ruthless affection.

35:19.170 --> 35:22.730
Do you know
if you forcibly break the spell,

35:22.730 --> 35:24.370
you could live a maximum of three days

35:25.010 --> 35:27.970
and you could never reincarnate?

35:34.330 --> 35:38.440
It doesn't matter.
I've already got what I wanted most.

35:41.090 --> 35:42.160
Madman.

36:33.230 --> 36:36.750
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

36:38.260 --> 36:41.550
♪Burns what once was♪

36:42.320 --> 36:45.160
♪The name is forgotten♪

36:49.260 --> 36:53.070
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

36:54.290 --> 36:57.200
♪Only through the eyes♪

36:58.030 --> 37:01.580
♪Who can see them clearly♪

37:03.220 --> 37:09.870
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

37:11.090 --> 37:17.930
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

37:19.280 --> 37:27.210
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

37:27.210 --> 37:34.190
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

37:51.220 --> 37:55.210
♪The seemingly random paths♪

37:56.270 --> 37:59.760
♪The burning traces♪

38:00.270 --> 38:04.560
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

38:07.150 --> 38:11.600
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

38:12.300 --> 38:15.630
♪Are all carefully♪

38:16.240 --> 38:20.300
♪Arranged by me♪

38:21.260 --> 38:28.620
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

38:29.200 --> 38:36.200
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

38:36.200 --> 38:45.200
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

38:45.200 --> 38:52.460
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

38:53.230 --> 39:00.650
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

39:01.230 --> 39:08.620
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

39:09.290 --> 39:16.810
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

39:17.360 --> 39:26.890
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
